               DIGITAL INTRODUCES EZ-SET UP CARTRIDGE


                      Industry's Fastest Device
               For Customizing Text Terminal Settings


MAYNARD, Mass. -- February 14, 1995 -- Digital Equipment 
Corporation's Video Line of Business today announced EZ-Set Up 
Cartridge, the industry's quickest and most efficient tool to 
custom-tailor terminal set up on Digital's VT500 and Dorio 
Terminals.  With EZ-Set Up Cartridge, distributors, VARs, resellers 
and MIS managers can customize terminal set-up features for groups 
of terminals in a few simple steps.

     The EZ-Set Up Cartridge eliminates the need to set up terminals 
individually via a time-consuming multi-keystroke process, or create 
and download a setting program from the host.  It enables users to 
copy settings from a pre-configured terminal to a cartridge and then 
use the cartridge to set up subsequent terminals easily.

     "Digital is committed to providing customers with efficient 
solutions that meet their evolving text terminal needs," said Bjorn 
Waenerlund, marketing manager, Video Line of Business.  "EZ-Set Up 
Cartridge is a significant proof point of this commitment.  It is an 
easy and cost-effective tool that increases user efficiency and 
productivity by enabling them to easily optimize VT and Dorio 
Terminal settings in seconds."

     "With over one thousand VT510 Terminals to configure with 
communication and logistics, the EZ-Set Up Cartridge is a critical 
tool for maximizing the efficiency of our health care facilities," 
explained Bill Mitchell, director of information services at 
Kelsey-Seybold.  Headquartered in Houston, Kelsey-Seybold is a 
primary and specialty medical clinic with locations throughout 
southeast Texas, and a test site for the EZ-Set Up Cartridge. "The 
EZ-Set Up Cartridge enabled us to customize and install terminals in 
our network within a much smaller window." 

     EZ-Set Up Cartridge will be available through Digital's 
distributors in early March.  Manufacturers suggested list price is 
$149.00

     Digital Equipment Corporation is the world's leader in open 
client/server solutions from personal computing to integrated 
worldwide information systems.  Digital's scalable Alpha platforms, 
storage, networking, software and services, together with industry-
focused solutions from business partners, help organizations compete 
and win in today's global marketplace.
