high-performance 64-bit Alpha Systems.
         
Fraud Management
         
     Digital's knowledge-based Fraud Management System 
substantially reduces the amount of fraud experienced by 
wireless operators.  A subscriber profile is generated 
immediately.  Flexible detection mechanisms, easily 
customized to pinpoint the fraud as defined by the subscriber 
profile, provide an adaptive fraud response.  Advanced data 
